#   text   AntCat derivation (only <i> markup), without the final citation
#   cite   page string when the author's own statement (read in the original description) is the source; None otherwise
#   gender a key of G (with argument after ':'), a full custom sentence starting 'Gender ', or None (no sentence: open or undecided)
